# Receipt-grade exact node identity names.  These strings are the cross-tool
# contract consumed by the EBNF obligation binder (cheng-fusion
# ebnf_parser_node_map.json lists the same member names); renaming an enum
# member without renaming its text breaks receipt verification, so every
# member is spelled out explicitly instead of being derived.
